# Local-only demo build artifacts (not shipped to remote)
# - build scripts and every PPTX output stay local; the PDF export is the shipped
#   copy. The pattern is repo-wide on purpose: decks are regenerated from the
#   build scripts (build_pptx.py, defense_pptx.py), so a committed .pptx would be
#   a large binary that goes stale the moment its source moves.
# - pandas tutorial is a generic, off-topic teaching notebook
build_pptx.py
build_notebook.py
*.pptx
pandas_30_core_features.ipynb

